# Real credentials. The repo is public, so this is a safety net rather than a
# convention: local.env is the filled-in copy of local/local.env.example and
# holds a live Cloudflare token. The negation keeps the committed template
# itself tracked.
*.env
!*.env.example

# Adapter facilities disk cache (scraper/adapters/teeitup.py) — never commit
.cache/
